CodeSystem: ICDASCariesScoreCS
Id: icdas-caries-score
Title: "ICDAS Caries Score"
Description: "ICDAS II coronal caries lesion scores from 0 through 6. Restoration and sealant status is outside this code system."
* ^url = "https://fhir.cognovis.de/dental/CodeSystem/icdas-caries-score"
* ^status = #active
* ^experimental = false
* ^caseSensitive = true
* ^content = #complete
* ^publisher = "cognovis GmbH"

* #0 "Sound tooth surface" "No evidence of caries after air drying."
* #1 "First visual change in enamel" "First visual change in enamel visible after prolonged air drying."
* #2 "Distinct visual change in enamel" "Distinct visual change in enamel visible when wet."
* #3 "Localized enamel breakdown" "Localized enamel breakdown without visible dentin."
* #4 "Underlying dark shadow from dentin" "Underlying dark shadow from dentin, with or without localized enamel breakdown."
* #5 "Distinct cavity with visible dentin" "Distinct cavity with visible dentin."
* #6 "Extensive distinct cavity with visible dentin" "Extensive distinct cavity with visible dentin."
